WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.325 --> 00:39.837
=Episode 27=

00:39.885 --> 00:42.600
(How Did This Brat Actually Do It?)

00:46.439 --> 00:47.040
Father-in-law.

00:49.799 --> 00:50.719
It's all settled?

00:50.919 --> 00:51.720
Yes.

00:54.800 --> 00:56.119
Don't worry, Father-in-law.

00:56.160 --> 00:57.359
It's no big deal.

00:57.359 --> 00:59.519
I said I could handle it, and I did.

00:59.519 --> 01:01.590
They're even coming to
the engagement banquet on the 22nd.

01:03.280 --> 01:03.920
Father-in-law,

01:03.920 --> 01:05.320
is there anything else you need?

01:05.679 --> 01:06.600
If not,

01:06.879 --> 01:09.760
I need to go pay a visit
to the lords at their mansions.

01:09.879 --> 01:11.600
Otherwise, they'll say I'm disrespectful.

01:11.600 --> 01:13.280
You're only thinking
of visiting them now?

01:13.290 --> 01:14.660
What were you doing these past few days?

01:14.679 --> 01:17.479
Wasn't I busy preparing
the things to deal with the great clans?

01:17.479 --> 01:18.990
I just finished
getting them ready yesterday.

01:19.159 --> 01:21.000
Don't ask me what I've prepared.

01:21.000 --> 01:21.679
I can't say.

01:22.439 --> 01:23.640
I gave the great clans my word.

01:24.119 --> 01:26.079
Otherwise, they'll really come after me.

01:28.079 --> 01:30.400
Father-in-law, if there's nothing else,
I'll head back.

01:30.439 --> 01:33.640
I'll be very busy these next few days,
so I might not have time to visit you.

01:33.759 --> 01:35.240
You must take good care of yourself.

01:35.439 --> 01:36.000
Get out.

01:36.399 --> 01:37.200
Get lost.

01:37.719 --> 01:38.620
For the next few days,

01:38.840 --> 01:40.000
I don't want to see your face.

01:41.159 --> 01:42.079
All right. Bye-bye.

01:44.439 --> 01:46.359
(This brat... Come on.)

01:46.799 --> 01:49.159
(He acts as if I
couldn't survive without him.)

01:49.319 --> 01:50.330
Oh, right, Father-in-law.

01:50.359 --> 01:51.680
Help me tell Mother-in-law

01:51.799 --> 01:53.439
that everything is fine now.

01:53.480 --> 01:54.239
It's all settled.

01:54.400 --> 01:55.519
Tell her not to worry.

01:56.590 --> 01:57.599
Don't forget to tell her.

02:03.920 --> 02:04.959
What method

02:05.280 --> 02:07.040
did the fool actually use?

02:08.920 --> 02:10.599
It must be that chest.

02:22.840 --> 02:24.000
So exhausted?

02:25.560 --> 02:26.439
Today,

02:26.879 --> 02:29.000
I visited 12 Lords' mansions.

02:29.280 --> 02:31.560
My voice is hoarse from all the talking.

02:32.400 --> 02:33.200
Aunt,

02:33.280 --> 02:34.200
what about you?

02:34.210 --> 02:35.200
How are the preparations?

02:35.200 --> 02:36.799
Everything is fine on my end.

02:37.400 --> 02:38.200
However,

02:38.439 --> 02:40.560
there's something
I'd like to discuss with you.

02:42.400 --> 02:43.359
You see,

02:43.560 --> 02:46.640
over the years,
I've made some close female friends.

02:46.959 --> 02:49.640
I'd like to invite them
to the banquet as well.

02:50.079 --> 02:51.520
But their social status

02:51.520 --> 02:53.360
isn't as noble
as that of the high officials.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.759
I'm afraid of embarrassing you.

02:56.719 --> 02:57.879
Just invite them.

02:58.159 --> 02:59.680
They're your friends, right?

02:59.680 --> 03:01.360
Friends are equal, regardless of status.

03:02.719 --> 03:03.400
Great.

03:04.360 --> 03:05.159
Young Madam,

03:05.280 --> 03:05.960
Young Master,

03:06.050 --> 03:07.400
the Clan Leader is here to visit.

03:07.560 --> 03:08.800
What is he doing here?

03:08.800 --> 03:09.850
It can't be anything good.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.199
Show him in.

03:13.862 --> 03:15.700
(Qichi)

03:20.719 --> 03:22.120
Why is it so warm in here?

03:22.960 --> 03:24.039
It's this heater.

03:24.240 --> 03:25.120
Hao made it.

03:25.120 --> 03:26.120
It's exceptionally warm.

03:27.560 --> 03:28.680
You brat.

03:29.240 --> 03:31.800
To think you actually have such skills.

03:31.800 --> 03:32.879
I was wondering why

03:32.919 --> 03:35.560
Juxian Restaurant was so warm.

03:38.759 --> 03:39.879
You came to see me,

03:40.039 --> 03:41.319
so it must be about money, right?

03:44.479 --> 03:45.599
You little brat.

03:46.439 --> 03:49.039
Sometimes, you
aren't such a fool, after all.

03:49.319 --> 03:50.120
Yes,

03:50.240 --> 03:51.639
it is about money.

03:53.199 --> 03:54.400
Regarding the money...

03:57.280 --> 03:58.319
Wei Hao,

03:59.000 --> 04:00.599
twenty thousand guan

04:00.879 --> 04:02.280
is too much.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.840
Even though the clan has it,

04:05.199 --> 04:07.879
we can't give it all to you.

04:08.199 --> 04:09.120
If we give it to you,

04:09.520 --> 04:10.639
and if anything

04:10.960 --> 04:12.759
happens to the clan,

04:12.800 --> 04:14.560
what will we do?

04:15.080 --> 04:16.439
What 20,000 guan?

04:17.840 --> 04:20.639
Hao, you're taking money
from the Clan Leader?

04:21.240 --> 04:22.039
That won't do.

04:22.080 --> 04:23.120
You can't break the rules.

04:23.120 --> 04:24.360
I'm not breaking any rules.

04:25.919 --> 04:26.879
Really.

04:28.039 --> 04:29.639
What I mean

04:29.800 --> 04:31.919
is that you should charge a bit less.

04:33.240 --> 04:34.639
Don't be so ruthless

04:34.919 --> 04:36.879
toward your own clan.

04:37.159 --> 04:39.680
Leave something for the clan.

04:42.800 --> 04:43.240
How...

04:43.560 --> 04:44.599
How much less?

04:44.960 --> 04:48.439
How about 10,000 guan less?

04:56.800 --> 04:57.840
Then, you tell me.

04:58.199 --> 04:59.199
How much less?

05:00.120 --> 05:01.040
I'm telling you,

05:01.120 --> 05:02.160
one thousand guan at most.

05:02.560 --> 05:03.560
Don't go too far.

05:03.560 --> 05:04.879
Even though I blew up your gate,

05:04.879 --> 05:06.639
think about it,
how much trouble did I save you?

05:06.639 --> 05:09.199
And besides, didn't my aunt already
give you the money to fix it?

05:09.519 --> 05:11.120
They have to pay me 20,000 guan,

05:11.120 --> 05:12.550
and not a single wen can be missing.

05:12.600 --> 05:13.560
Furthermore,

05:13.639 --> 05:15.800
since I'm a member of the Wei clan,

05:15.800 --> 05:17.190
I didn't even go all out this time.

05:17.330 --> 05:18.600
If I had really shown no mercy,

05:18.610 --> 05:20.950
would you still be in the mood
to talk about money here?

05:21.079 --> 05:23.279
You'd better think about your own head.

05:23.800 --> 05:24.720
Right.

05:25.759 --> 05:26.560
Clan Leader,

05:26.879 --> 05:29.319
what exactly is going on here?

05:29.680 --> 05:30.920
It is like this.

05:31.319 --> 05:33.519
It's due to some matters
within the clans.

05:33.720 --> 05:34.439
I...

05:34.439 --> 05:36.040
I can't go into the specifics

05:36.199 --> 05:37.800
with you.

05:38.720 --> 05:40.639
Because of these matters,

05:41.040 --> 05:43.240
we must compensate Wei Hao

05:43.560 --> 05:45.279
twenty thousand guan.

05:49.480 --> 05:50.920
You are aware

05:51.079 --> 05:53.120
that the clan does have this much money,

05:53.360 --> 05:56.160
but we cannot give it all to Wei Hao.

05:56.720 --> 05:57.839
Young Madam Lin,

05:58.199 --> 05:59.920
please help me persuade him.

06:00.240 --> 06:01.040
Aunt,

06:01.720 --> 06:03.079
it has nothing to do with you.

06:04.959 --> 06:06.360
Twenty thousand guan...

06:06.720 --> 06:07.519
That much?

06:11.560 --> 06:12.600
Think about it.

06:13.360 --> 06:16.759
This money is the clan's reserve fund.

06:17.040 --> 06:20.879
The clan has too many things
that need funding.

06:21.879 --> 06:24.920
We need to provide
subsidies for those officials

06:25.120 --> 06:25.920
and

06:26.040 --> 06:28.639
scholars.

06:29.240 --> 06:30.199
Also,

06:30.519 --> 06:31.399
when there are

06:32.079 --> 06:34.160
weddings or funerals in the clan,

06:34.279 --> 06:37.480
the clan needs to provide the money.

06:37.560 --> 06:38.519
Also,

06:39.199 --> 06:43.319
if the clan suffers a huge misfortune,

06:43.720 --> 06:46.519
the clan must also provide funds.

06:46.920 --> 06:50.319
There are quite a few things
that need money.

06:51.959 --> 06:52.759
Yes,

06:52.839 --> 06:54.199
I know.

06:54.360 --> 06:55.160
Tell you what,

06:55.240 --> 06:56.240
I'll take the lead.

06:56.399 --> 06:58.759
Then, let's reduce it by 2,000 guan.

06:58.839 --> 06:59.639
How about that?

06:59.959 --> 07:02.519
Any more than that,
and it's out of my hands.

07:03.240 --> 07:04.040
Well,

07:04.920 --> 07:06.319
that's fine,

07:06.319 --> 07:07.079
but

07:07.920 --> 07:10.240
could it be a bit less?

07:11.800 --> 07:13.639
Come on, don't go too far.

07:13.879 --> 07:15.079
Reducing it by 2,000 guan

07:15.280 --> 07:16.800
is already showing you great respect.

07:16.800 --> 07:19.600
Hao, how can you speak to
the Clan Leader like that?

07:22.399 --> 07:23.279
How about this?

07:23.399 --> 07:25.480
Let's make it another 1,000 guan less.

07:26.240 --> 07:28.000
Clan Leader, don't say another word.

07:28.000 --> 07:30.360
If you keep talking,
even the 3,000 reduction will be gone.

07:30.360 --> 07:31.000
Fine,

07:31.040 --> 07:32.199
three thousand less it is.

07:34.439 --> 07:35.240
Wei Hao,

07:35.240 --> 07:35.879
you

07:36.079 --> 07:37.000
deserve this.

07:39.360 --> 07:40.160
Clan Leader,

07:40.519 --> 07:41.879
can you tell me now

07:41.879 --> 07:43.399
what exactly is going on?

07:43.439 --> 07:45.120
Yesterday's matter
has been settled, then?

07:45.120 --> 07:46.240
What do you think?

07:47.079 --> 07:49.639
I have even brought the money.

07:50.160 --> 07:51.519
On the 22nd,

07:51.680 --> 07:53.800
when you hold the engagement banquet,

07:54.000 --> 07:57.160
the other clan leaders
and I will all attend.

07:57.560 --> 07:58.800
This brat.

07:59.000 --> 08:01.560
Looking at it from another perspective,

08:01.959 --> 08:04.759
he has brought honor to our clan.

08:05.040 --> 08:07.079
He is really a talent.

08:12.279 --> 08:13.079
By the way,

08:13.360 --> 08:14.399
Wei Hao,

08:15.480 --> 08:17.879
since you are holding
an engagement banquet,

08:17.920 --> 08:18.720
for

08:19.000 --> 08:21.279
the younger generation of our clan

08:21.360 --> 08:22.680
who are officials in the capital,

08:22.959 --> 08:25.920
shouldn't you send them an invitation?

08:27.600 --> 08:28.519
I don't have a list.

08:28.519 --> 08:29.800
I have one here!

08:32.959 --> 08:33.800
How about this?

08:35.560 --> 08:36.360
Tomorrow,

08:36.399 --> 08:38.839
I'll have someone deliver it to you.

08:39.240 --> 08:40.279
When the time comes,

08:40.399 --> 08:43.720
you should also send someone
to deliver the invitations.

08:44.240 --> 08:45.560
They really should be invited.

08:45.560 --> 08:47.500
After all, he'll be
an official in court later.

08:47.600 --> 08:49.240
Our own clan is more trustworthy.

08:49.560 --> 08:50.600
Invite them if you must.

08:51.079 --> 08:51.879
Invite them all.

08:52.120 --> 08:53.800
It's just a few more sets of chopsticks.

08:55.160 --> 08:56.240
In that case,

08:56.360 --> 08:58.560
I will head back first.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.680
Hao, quick.

08:59.720 --> 09:00.690
See the Clan Leader out.

09:15.440 --> 09:17.759
Young Madam, I think there's
something fishy about this.

09:20.600 --> 09:21.679
I've got it.

09:21.700 --> 09:24.120
It must be because the Young Master
blew up the clan leaders' main gates,

09:24.120 --> 09:25.990
and the compensation
is so high that he can't afford it,

09:26.000 --> 09:27.840
but he can't tell you that directly.

09:28.480 --> 09:29.279
So,

09:29.320 --> 09:31.159
they conspired to put on this act.

09:33.480 --> 09:36.240
The fool is really something.

09:37.000 --> 09:38.960
Blowing up so many gates in one go...

09:39.440 --> 09:41.279
No normal person
could ever do such a thing.

09:42.200 --> 09:44.639
One main gate costs about 2,000 guan.

09:45.240 --> 09:47.360
With so many gates,
how much would that be?

09:48.440 --> 09:50.360
Wouldn't it wipe out
the entire clan fortune?

09:50.360 --> 09:51.240
Young Master...

09:51.240 --> 09:52.000
Xiu,

09:52.919 --> 09:53.720
there is something

09:53.720 --> 09:55.690
I've actually wanted
to tell you for a long time.

09:56.240 --> 09:57.320
Go ahead, Young Madam.

09:58.679 --> 10:00.120
Even though Hao never knew

10:00.120 --> 10:01.780
you were badmouthing him
behind his back,

10:02.000 --> 10:02.960
I...

10:03.879 --> 10:05.720
I really can't take it anymore.

10:07.360 --> 10:08.679
Pack your things quickly

10:08.879 --> 10:09.960
and leave the Wei mansion.

10:10.840 --> 10:12.559
Young Madam, please don't.

10:12.919 --> 10:14.799
Now is the time
the Wei clan is thriving.

10:14.799 --> 10:16.519
I can't leave right now.

10:16.840 --> 10:18.399
So you know our clan is thriving, huh?

10:18.559 --> 10:19.639
Then, who do you think

10:19.639 --> 10:20.840
brought about all this glory?

10:23.840 --> 10:25.039
It was the Young Master.

10:25.120 --> 10:26.080
So, why do you always

10:26.080 --> 10:27.240
twist the facts in front of me

10:27.240 --> 10:28.950
and refuse to acknowledge
Hao's excellence?

10:29.399 --> 10:30.759
I'm just not convinced.

10:31.200 --> 10:32.840
What right do you
have to be unconvinced?

10:33.000 --> 10:34.790
What made you forget
your place as a servant?

10:34.960 --> 10:36.240
I'm just resentful.

10:36.700 --> 10:38.480
Back then,
you could have taken me with you

10:38.480 --> 10:39.919
to marry into
the Ningyuan Marquis's house.

10:39.919 --> 10:41.919
But it was because of this fool

10:42.080 --> 10:43.480
that your marriage was delayed,

10:43.480 --> 10:45.519
and my whole life was ruined as well.

10:46.240 --> 10:47.360
Ningyuan Marquis?

10:48.159 --> 10:49.360
Did I even know him?

10:52.000 --> 10:53.039
Young Madam,

10:54.170 --> 10:57.120
you don't even remember the eldest son
of the Ningyuan Marquis's residence?

10:58.639 --> 10:59.759
Why is it that you only

10:59.759 --> 11:01.399
have eyes for Wei the Fool?

11:02.600 --> 11:04.480
Is "Wei the Fool"
a name you're allowed to use?

11:05.600 --> 11:06.399
Mister Wang!

11:10.240 --> 11:11.440
Expel Xiu from the mansion.

11:11.440 --> 11:12.890
She is never to enter
the Wei clan again.

11:14.510 --> 11:15.320
Young Madam, don't.

11:15.320 --> 11:16.120
Xiu, let's go.

11:16.120 --> 11:18.440
I haven't even enjoyed
a good life with you yet.

11:18.440 --> 11:19.240
Just go.

11:19.600 --> 11:21.159
Young Madam is being merciful.

11:21.500 --> 11:23.799
In any other household,
you would have been killed long ago.

11:23.799 --> 11:26.039
Mister Wang, please plead for me.

11:26.039 --> 11:27.320
Plead for you?

11:27.799 --> 11:29.480
I've put up with you for long enough.

11:29.559 --> 11:30.679
Plead for you?

11:30.720 --> 11:31.519
Get out of here!

11:31.840 --> 11:32.919
Still asking for mercy?

11:33.639 --> 11:34.320
Go.

11:34.679 --> 11:36.519
Don't drive me away.

11:37.887 --> 11:40.399
(Juxian Restaurant)

11:40.399 --> 11:42.320
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

11:42.500 --> 11:43.159
Congratulations.

11:43.159 --> 11:43.960
Careful now.

11:44.687 --> 11:46.048
(Juxian Restaurant)
Come, put it right here.

11:48.000 --> 11:48.879
Please come inside.

11:48.879 --> 11:49.960
Please come on in.

11:53.840 --> 11:54.679
You brat,

11:54.679 --> 11:55.480
not bad.

11:56.240 --> 11:57.039
Mister Cheng,

11:57.120 --> 11:58.919
you can drink your fill tonight.

11:58.919 --> 12:00.200
Don't you worry about that.

12:01.280 --> 12:02.759
- Congratulations.
- Congratulations.

12:02.759 --> 12:03.360
Same to you.

12:03.360 --> 12:04.120
Come, sit.

12:04.440 --> 12:05.000
Sit down.

12:06.320 --> 12:07.919
Hao,

12:07.960 --> 12:09.080
they are...

12:09.480 --> 12:11.200
The Ministers of Works,
War, and Revenue.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.399
The Ministers?

12:14.720 --> 12:16.279
Greetings, Your Highness.

12:16.279 --> 12:17.080
At ease.

12:17.360 --> 12:18.080
Wei Hao,

12:18.080 --> 12:20.080
you handled this matter brilliantly.

12:20.399 --> 12:21.080
I'm impressed.

12:21.080 --> 12:22.080
Of course.

12:22.480 --> 12:24.360
Brother-in-law,
you must drink well tonight.

12:24.480 --> 12:25.279
Upstairs, please.

12:27.320 --> 12:28.480
This way, please.

12:31.279 --> 12:32.200
Young Master Wei.

12:32.200 --> 12:32.840
Congratulations.

12:32.840 --> 12:33.639
Congratulations, Young Master Wei.

12:33.639 --> 12:34.480
Thank you.

12:35.399 --> 12:36.519
Did you bring the things?

12:37.159 --> 12:38.279
We brought everything.

12:38.279 --> 12:39.000
Aunt,

12:39.480 --> 12:40.200
follow them

12:40.200 --> 12:40.919
to the warehouse.

12:41.200 --> 12:42.440
It's 20,000 guan for each clan.

12:43.600 --> 12:44.399
How much?

12:45.120 --> 12:46.799
Twenty thousand guan for each clan?

12:46.799 --> 12:47.559
Go on now.

12:47.960 --> 12:48.759
Alright.

12:49.279 --> 12:50.679
Gentlemen, please follow me inside.

12:50.679 --> 12:51.480
Alright.

12:54.440 --> 12:55.919
I knew this brat had potential.

12:56.360 --> 12:57.039
Just look at him.

13:00.159 --> 13:01.080
This brat

13:01.600 --> 13:03.000
actually has such a capability

13:03.440 --> 13:06.000
to get these heads of houses to attend
with so many gifts?

13:06.240 --> 13:07.879
How do you think he did it?

13:08.799 --> 13:10.120
I have no idea, either.

13:10.639 --> 13:11.480
In any case,

13:11.480 --> 13:13.000
I couldn't have pulled it off.

13:13.840 --> 13:14.759
Let's head upstairs.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.000
Upstairs, please.

13:16.000 --> 13:16.639
Alright.

13:16.639 --> 13:17.600
I bet

13:17.600 --> 13:19.000
even His Majesty is curious.

13:19.000 --> 13:20.120
Tonight,

13:20.120 --> 13:21.320
we must get him drunk.

13:21.679 --> 13:22.600
Then, we'll ask him

13:22.879 --> 13:24.480
how he actually did it.

13:24.840 --> 13:25.799
Good idea.

13:26.120 --> 13:26.759
Cheng,

13:26.840 --> 13:28.200
we're counting on you later.

13:31.840 --> 13:32.519
Please.

13:34.919 --> 13:35.720
Wei Hao.

13:36.159 --> 13:36.799
Wei Hao!

13:37.200 --> 13:37.759
Coming.

13:42.440 --> 13:43.559
Greetings, Father-in-law.

13:44.039 --> 13:45.360
Greetings, Mother-in-law.

13:53.375 --> 13:56.205
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

13:56.825 --> 14:00.225
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

14:00.995 --> 14:03.945
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

14:04.285 --> 14:06.985
♪Sigh and walk away♪

14:08.585 --> 14:12.055
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

14:12.055 --> 14:14.285
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

14:14.285 --> 14:16.395
♪Colors and darkness♪

14:16.395 --> 14:18.415
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

14:18.415 --> 14:22.775
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

14:24.215 --> 14:27.945
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

14:28.215 --> 14:31.815
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

14:31.975 --> 14:34.055
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

14:34.055 --> 14:38.845
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

14:39.065 --> 14:40.685
♪The world mistakes me♪

14:40.685 --> 14:43.025
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

14:43.095 --> 14:44.285
♪As the storm approaches♪

14:44.285 --> 14:46.685
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

14:46.895 --> 14:48.615
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

14:48.615 --> 14:50.595
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

14:50.765 --> 14:52.515
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

14:52.515 --> 14:54.615
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

14:54.615 --> 14:56.085
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

14:56.085 --> 14:58.315
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

14:58.535 --> 14:59.735
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

14:59.735 --> 15:02.255
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

15:02.385 --> 15:04.095
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

15:04.095 --> 15:05.375
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

15:05.525 --> 15:06.945
♪My wish has finally come true♪

15:06.945 --> 15:07.985
♪To stay by your side♪

15:07.985 --> 15:09.905
♪In this fleeting world♪

15:10.075 --> 15:13.325
♪We are free and happy♪

15:17.325 --> 15:19.105
♪From a nobody♪

15:19.105 --> 15:21.005
♪To someone now famous♪

15:21.115 --> 15:22.545
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

15:22.545 --> 15:25.055
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

15:25.155 --> 15:26.735
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

15:26.735 --> 15:28.805
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

15:29.015 --> 15:30.695
♪In this vast world♪

15:30.695 --> 15:32.695
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

15:32.845 --> 15:35.055
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

15:35.055 --> 15:36.645
♪Everything ends eventually♪

15:36.735 --> 15:38.235
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

15:38.235 --> 15:40.635
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

15:40.635 --> 15:42.345
♪No matter how time flies♪

15:42.345 --> 15:43.505
♪Even if the falling snow♪

15:43.505 --> 15:45.135
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

15:45.135 --> 15:46.175
♪All I want now♪

15:46.175 --> 15:48.275
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

15:48.275 --> 15:51.535
♪Year after year♪
